  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bougainville Capacities for Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peacebuilding and political actors, including the Autonomous Bougainville Government (ABG), the Government of Papua New Guinea (GoPNG), Bougainville civil society and community leaders have the skills, joint analysis, and the relationships to effectively address emerging conflict issues
in Bougainville.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="4" type="23">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will be implemented in partnership with CR&#x2019;s local partner in Bougainville, the Nazareth Centre for Rehabilitation (NCFR). With CR&#x2019;s support (support to conduct analysis, plan activity and capture learnings and results), NCFR will conduct peacebuilding and advanced peacebuilding workshops</narrative>
  </participating-org>
